Failure mechanism: Dockerfile defaults USER_UID=1000 and USER_GID=1000, then executes groupadd -g 1000 vncuser. Both official platform roots already own UID/GID 1000 as ubuntu; the ARM64 clean build exited at that groupadd with status 4.
